  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will support economic growth driven by the private sector. it will increase micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSME) productivity; create demand driven professionals; improve access to finance for micro, small, and start-up firms and facilitate investments for msmes; strengthen existing public-private dialogue (PPD) mechanisms; and to improve north macedonias regional economic integration.</narrative>
  </description>
